  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole organism with long backward tubular head crest, not isolated skull or substituted species. [\"Soft tissue, colour and exact limb/tail proportions are reconstructed; no skin-colour claim.\", \"Crest is hollow internally but mesh may use a solid lowpoly silhouette; do not add arbitrary exposed nostril tube openings.\", \"No asserted neck frill/web, snorkel function, crest-to-back contact or pathological back saddle.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 9.0, \"basis\": \"NHM genus-level approximate size, used as artistic adult target; not a measured ROM768 complete length.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole organism with long backward tubular head crest, not isolated skull or substituted species. [\"Soft tissue, colour and exact limb/tail proportions are reconstructed; no skin-colour claim.\", \"Crest is hollow internally but mesh may use a solid lowpoly silhouette; do not add arbitrary exposed nostril tube openings.\", \"No asserted neck frill/web, snorkel function, crest-to-back contact or pathological back saddle.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 9.0, \"basis\": \"NHM genus-level approximate size, used as artistic adult target; not a measured ROM768 complete length.\"}"
